# Day 6 — Solution: Week-6 Spot-Check

## 1. From memory — reference

(a) Survivorship (dead excluded → up), selection (shown because good →
up), look-ahead (future in past → up), snooping (many tries, one shown
→ up). All four point the same way in practice.
(b) n=252, σ=1%: mean 0.063%, SD 0.045%, skew 0.155, kurt 0.31.
(c) 1.4826 = 1/Φ⁻¹(0.75) — rescales MAD to SD-matching at normality.
(d) One k-σ point in n: kurtosis contribution ≈ k⁴/n.
(e) Winsorize = cap at quantiles (keep the day, shrink it); trim =
drop the extremes.
(f) Detect robustly → verify externally (calendar/volume/news) →
report with AND without → never silently delete.

## 2. Two computations

```python
import numpy as np
se_skew = np.sqrt(6/1008)
print(f"skew: {-0.5/se_skew:.1f} SE from zero")
se_mean = 0.011/np.sqrt(252)
print(f"mean: {0.0009/se_mean:.1f} SE from zero")
```

Skew: −0.5/0.077 ≈ **6.5 SE** — decisive. Mean: 0.09%/0.069% ≈
**1.3 SE** — a single year's mean of +0.09% is indistinguishable from
zero. Same data, same n, one verdict crisp and one mushy: the moments
have different prices.

## 3. The drill (reference output shape)

```python
import os, sys, pathlib
root = pathlib.Path.cwd()
for _ in range(6):
    if (root / "qrc").is_dir():
        break
    root = root.parent
if str(root) not in sys.path:
    sys.path.insert(0, str(root))
DATA_SOURCE = os.environ.get("QRC_DATA", "real")
from qrc.data import get_prices
from qrc.synth import synthetic_prices
if DATA_SOURCE == "real":
    r = get_prices("SPY", start="1993-01-01")["SPY"].pct_change().dropna()
else:
    r = synthetic_prices(n_days=8000, n_assets=1, seed=31)["S0"].pct_change().dropna()
z = (r - r.mean()) / r.std()
mad = 1.4826 * np.median(np.abs(r - r.median()))
n = len(r)
print(f"n={n}: mean {r.mean():+.5f} | median {r.median():+.5f} | SD {r.std():.4f} | "
      f"MAD {mad:.4f} | skew {z.skew():+.2f}±{np.sqrt(6/n):.2f} | "
      f"kurt {(z**4).mean()-3:.1f}±{np.sqrt(24/n):.1f}")
```

If this took >15 minutes, tomorrow's project will overrun — the
mini-project is this drill × 3 assets + 6 facts.
